gration</strong>:  Your stream audience is your game audience.  In-game fans will cheer and celebrate in response to stream chat commands.<br></li><li><strong>Cosmetics</strong>: Support a cause or pro team, or just look cool wearing one of a large collection of player skins.<br></li><li><strong>Online Tournaments</strong>: (Coming Soon!) Participate in online regional tournaments, or organize your own with our tournament support tools.<br></li><li><strong>ESports</strong>: (Coming Soon!) Tournament-winning teams will have an opportunity to compete in global championships for cash prizes.</li></ul>", "short_description": "StarBall is the sport of tomorrow. Play 2-on-2 ball in zero gravity. Pass, shoot, block, and save in an arena where no direction is up or down! Hone your skills against the AI championship league in career mode, then compete online solo or with a teammate.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821870/header.jpg?t=1660064493", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821870/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1660064493", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/821870/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1660064493", "website": "http://www.blanketfortgames.com/press/sheet.php?p=starball", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 5th Gen Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> SteamVR. Standing or Room Scale</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Blanket Fort Game